; mormiCommander — magyar nyelvi fájl (Hungarian language file), issue #113.
; Lines are "English text=Hungarian text"; an "=" in the English text is written "\=", a line break "\n".
; Built in: choose it in Options > Language by setting the interface language to hu (or the language file to hu.lng).
; Texts not listed here stay English. The full list of texts: lang/template.lng (frontend: npm run lang:template).

